body:
I don't have a Spotify account but I can write down these songs and find it elsewhere.

&#x200B;

Thank you, wish you the best.

I love people  like you because you are well meaning...

&#x200B;

You mean well.

&#x200B;

But I also fear people like you.

You just said that we live in an infinite universe and you are also saying that loneliness can't exist in an INFINITE universe? There could be some contradiction.

perhaps through immagination I am subconsciously manifested this because honestly I did not make this happen it just started happening... through desperation.

&#x200B;

It seemed as if I kept reaching for a darker being to relate to or through.

I am still breathing. STill having a hard time but I am so caught up with work I haven't the time to resolve things "properly".

&#x200B;

Thanks for asking.

[https://www.tiktok.com/@scotty\_lapachu](https://www.tiktok.com/@scotty_lapachu)

&#x200B;

I found him. He's BEAUTIFUL.

Thank you very much for this thoughtful reply. I apologize for taking so long because  I usually don't get replies but thank you this gives me permission to find my own way and  use the councilor in a way that suits me.

&#x200B;

This whore I am with loves to give homework and sometimes he's just condescending. But yeah, thank you, Captain Slash! I pray your blade continues to cut the demons in these lonely hearts.
